Hi,<br><br>   BTW, it wasn't possible to use anything else than the 83 "standard" DCS codes, <a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Squelch#DCS" class="postlink">see</a>, the code can't permit that, from the beginning (even if the CPS had a bug that permitted to enter it, which I can't remember).<br>In the CPS, the unsupported DCS codes were removed from the drop-down lists on May 2021.<br><br><br>Cheers.<br>---<br>Daniel<p>Statistics: Posted by <a href="http://localhost/opengd77/memberlist.php?mode=viewprofile&amp;u=56">F1RMB</a> — Sat Apr 13, 2024 5:44 am</p><hr />
]]></content>
